Package: TaxaExpect
Title: Kernel Priors for Expected Species Composition from Occurrence Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Kevin", "Lafferty", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "klafferty@usgs.gov")
Description: Estimates theta priors -- each taxon's expected share of the
    detections at a site -- for taxonomic assignment, from occurrence records
    (see TaxaFetch). A site-centered kernel estimator weights occurrence points
    by distance, with optional depth and habitat conditioning, and evidence
    layers add undetected diversity, regional proximity, iNaturalist ranges,
    invasive watch lists and domestic or food species. Part of the TaxaID
    ecosystem.
